{"id":"wb-7-1216","name":"槐山矶驳岸","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"槐山矶驳岸","text":"槐山矶驳岸，又称槐山矶石驳岸，位于中华人民共和国湖北省武汉市江夏区槐山西麓的长江江岸上，是长江仅存的古代航运建筑设施。该建筑始建于明代嘉靖年间，此后曾有多次修葺。该驳岸全长247米，由上至下共分三层纤道，以供古时船只拉纤停靠。2013年，槐山矶驳岸被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A7%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B6%E9%A9%B3%E5%B2%B8","revisionId":86856938,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856938","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/22bf457105fe40a58e369f6e.jpg","title":"槐山矶驳岸_20240314.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A7%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B6%E9%A9%B3%E5%B2%B8_20240314.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/%E6%A7%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B6%E9%A9%B3%E5%B2%B8_20240314.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Uuongkinghe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​槐山矶驳岸","width":320,"height":427}}